Subject: [PATCH] Never wipe a library because a share answered empty

A network rescan that would remove most of the library under a root
(NAS still asleep, volume mounted empty, partial listing) is deferred
until the next scan confirms it, Kodi-like. Real removals are applied
one scan later. Covers the 'libraries getting lost' reports.
